#: ../../source/model-zoo.md:1 91ecf41e22364c2b9c62091b8b835601
msgid "Model Zoo"
msgstr "Model Zoo"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md:3 119eadc5621c4fbf9a4fb4de99b348eb
msgid "UniKT 内置 35 个知识追踪模型，覆盖序列模型、图神经网络模型、注意力机制模型等多个方向。本页列出了所有已支持的模型及其基准测试结果。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT ships with 35 knowledge tracing models spanning sequence models, graph "
"neural network models, attention-based models, and more. This page lists all "
"supported models and their benchmark results."

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md:5 c8140da64aae40cea60bc9f93e9b6bcf
msgid "评估协议"
msgstr "Evaluation protocol"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md:7 0fce177e779e46cf8e113607290c893f
msgid "UniKT 采用标准化评估协议，确保所有模型在同一条件下公平对比："
msgstr ""
"UniKT adopts a standardized evaluation protocol to ensure all models are "
"compared fairly under identical conditions:"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md 5b1f3c231a504dd28321bc4c328bd197
msgid "项目"
msgstr "Item"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md 698876cc9dfc4e69a16cf3dd9cec7665
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md a5396b2ec97a4998a40a249f06f8967b
msgid "交叉验证"
msgstr "Cross validation"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md 2bdd8167020b4032ac0948babf79c277
msgid "5 折交叉验证 (5-fold cross-validation)，按用户分层划分"
msgstr "5-fold cross-validation, partitioned with user-level stratification"

