msgstr "Supports both KC-level and question-level evaluation granularity"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md 958e529c1b81455aa85ebef4a28ded44
msgid "主要指标"
msgstr "Primary metrics"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md 7ed666a28ad74ed3af60bd9425343505
msgid "AUC 和 ACC，报告 5 折均值 ± 标准差"
msgstr "AUC and ACC, reported as 5-fold mean ± standard deviation"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md b406961fc24345239f6e40fbed150506
msgid "数据划分"
msgstr "Data split"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md 5bf50b0e8f3f46949ac978463558c912
msgid "按 fold 参数指定当前折，训练/验证/测试集按 80%/10%/10% 自动划分"
msgstr ""
"The current fold is selected via the fold parameter; train/validation/test "
"sets are split automatically at 80%/10%/10%"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md cca552fdb96949c1a828a60af1adf4bb
msgid "早停"
msgstr "Early stopping"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md 48bc368ad5e945f999941f9cb00cdc3d
msgid "patience=10，监控 AUC，best 模型恢复"
msgstr "patience=10, monitors AUC, restores the best model"

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md:19 54b281925d7641bda1dcc4b1257bf39f
msgid "标注“UniKT 复现”的为本框架自行复现的模型代码，与原论文实现可能存在差异。"
msgstr ""
"Models marked \"UniKT reproduction\" are reimplemented within this framework "
"and may differ from the original paper's implementation."

#: ../../source/model-zoo.md:22 dde96277c26b4185afb8b99a09c70827
msgid "排行榜"
