#: ../../source/model-zoo.md:24 962881a0d7904488b37e721673eb90a8
msgid "以下交互式表格展示所有模型在标准数据集上的基准结果。可按数据集标签筛选，按列排序，鼠标悬停 AUC/ACC 查看每折详细数据。"
msgstr ""
"The interactive table below shows benchmark results for all models on "
"standard datasets. Filter by dataset tag, sort by column, and hover over "
"AUC/ACC to view per-fold details."

